msgctxt "10579\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man shrouded in a veil of secrets. Who is he really, and why is\n"
"he fighting in the Coliseum? His highly trained fists, said to be\n"
"possessed by the Devil himself, have knocked out countless tough\n"
"guys. The strongest man alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10807\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Master martial artist and founder of Komaki-style martial arts.\n"
"His unusually strong physique continues to improve and evolve as\n"
"he ages. He has come to the Coliseum to challenge himself and\n"
"promote the Komaki style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11024\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A karate master taking the Underground Coliseum by storm with his\n"
"brilliant strategic mind and his devastating strikes which belie\n"
"his diminutive size."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11176\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Living successor of Hozoin-ryu spearmanship, which has been passed down\n"
"since the Azuchi-Momoyama period. His spear mastery and his physical\n"
"prowess surpass even that of the style's founder, In'ei Hozoin. Casting\n"
"himself into the Coliseum ring to show the world the spirit of Hozoin-ryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11464\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"After having run out of opponents who could fight against him at\n"
"his full strength in the kickboxing world, he has come to the\n"
"Underground Coliseum looking for better opponents. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11643\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A skilled fighter and quintessential Thai kickboxer. His uniquely distanced\n"
"kicks have crushed the bodies and spirits of many a kickboxer. He plans on\n"
"keeping up that fighting spirit in the Underground Coliseum, kicking his\n"
"way through all the men lined up to fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11910\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"The man who ruled the wrestling world with his inhuman strength. He now\n"
"participates in fighting competitions outside of the wrestling scene to\n"
"prove wrestling is the strongest fighting style. He has come to the\n"
"Underground Coliseum to fight in his final frontier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12175\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A master of ancient Ryukyu martial arts. Said to be a master not\n"
"just of the ancient style but also with nunchaku. After hearing\n"
"about a tournament to determine the strongest fighter, he made\n"
"his way to the Underground Coliseum all the way from Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12429\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Once this giant enters the ring, he won't stop his rampage until someone\n"
"jumps in to stop him. His reign of terror continued even out of the ring,\n"
"which has caused multiple incidents. Now, he's come to the Underground\n"
"Coliseum, where his rampage will be put to good use."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12700\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A karate master who has turned his body into a deadly weapon. Even well\n"
"into his sixties, he still fights at full power. Instead of training a new\n"
"generation of martial artists, he has instead chosen to focus on honing his\n"
"own strength. That pursuit has taken him to the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12993\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A masked fighter with a history of evil acts in the pro wrestling\n"
"ring. He came to the Underground Coliseum looking for a fight,\n"
"but he also seeks an opportunity to get revenge on those in the\n"
"pro wrestling world who he holds a grudge against."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13237\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A powerful fighter descended from a long, proud line of combatants.\n"
"His powerful build, a result of his genes, acts as an impenetrable shield\n"
"that can block the strongest attacks and deal powerful blows as well.\n"
"He came to the Underground Coliseum in pursuit of the fight money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13516\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A professional combatant who narrowly escaped death multiple times\n"
"as a soldier. He'll take on any mission as long as he gets paid.\n"
"When he doesn't have work, he goes to the Underground Coliseum to\n"
"train in combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13731\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A young hopeful who rules the world of Japanese kickboxing with\n"
"his weaponized knee kicks. He was the youngest person to break\n"
"numerous kickboxing records. Now, no longer satisfied with\n"
"aboveboard fights, he's coming down to the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13982\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A philosopher who searches for truth in the heat of battle. He believes\n"
"human nature can only be truly known in a place where life and death\n"
"happen. In pursuit of this knowledge, he has come to participate in the\n"
"Underground Coliseum to encounter more life-threatening fights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14259\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This boxer was driven out of the sport in his home country after it was\n"
"discovered that he was fixing his own fights. Now, he comes to the \n"
"Coliseum, longing for more time in the ring. His light footwork and\n"
"strong punches have built before him a mountain of KO'd opponents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14534\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An artist who is always trying new things in the fighting world.\n"
"He has come to the Underground Coliseum to test new techniques he\n"
"has invented. Rumors say that behind his beautiful techniques lie\n"
"the countless corpses of the men he tested them on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14783\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Despite his brilliant mind, when his mafia ties were discovered, his fight\n"
"license was stripped from him. Afterwards, he tried multiple times to\n"
"return but was never accepted. Just as he was feeling down about it,\n"
"someone involved with the Underground Coliseum recruited him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15059\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A sumo wrestler who was driven from the top of the sumo world for\n"
"his poor behavior and numerous controversial statements. However,\n"
"he is still passionate about sumo wrestling, and is ready to bring\n"
"the traditional fighting style to the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15318\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A wandering pro wrestler who will go anywhere as long as there's\n"
"a wrestling ring. He competed in rings around the world, taking\n"
"on strong fighters left and right. Now, his next target is the\n"
"fighting ring at the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15553\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A confident strongarm fighter with the utmost confidence in his ability to\n"
"strike true. He proudly declares that his favorite thing to do is punch a\n"
"man in the face. He earned the nickname of \"Prince\" from the wide grin he\n"
"wears when punching someone in the face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15817\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A street fighting specialist who is the pride of Japan's top-class gang\n"
"organization. His fighting prowess was honed through countless battles\n"
"and scuffles. He came to the Underground Coliseum to make his\n"
"organization known to the underworld."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16060\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Knows every nook and cranny of the human body and where to strike\n"
"to cause the most damage. His brass knuckles are perfect for\n"
"breaking and busting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16209\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"By day, a famous CEO of an IT company. By night, a fierce man who\n"
"invests millions of yen into training his body to better fight in\n"
"the ring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16351\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A Japanese man who has chosen fighting as his path in life. His\n"
"past is shrouded in mystery, but he says he was born on the\n"
"battlefield. His stoic nature has earned him the passionate\n"
"support of the discerning audience of the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16599\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Was once expected to become the world champion, but when he found\n"
"himself unable to tangle with gyms and promoters any longer, he\n"
"disappeared from the boxing ring. Afterwards, he was recruited by\n"
"Majima and stepped into the ring once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16839\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man who runs a remodeling business in Kamurocho. Despite his bulk, he\n"
"moves with unexpected grace and precision while wielding his beloved\n"
"weapon to deadly effect. He has come to the Underground Coliseum upon\n"
"the orders of his weapon arts master, Shoji Yonashiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17105\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"After defying all expectations and winning many title matches, he earned\n"
"the nickname \"The Enigma Machine.\" However, because he kept being\n"
"suspected of match fixing every time he won an unexpected victory, he\n"
"decided to come to the Coliseum, where match fixing doesn't exist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17381\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A kickboxer who possesses secret tactics one could never expect\n"
"based on the gaudy way he dresses. Said to send his opponents\n"
"straight to Hell. He has a long career at the Underground\n"
"Coliseum and knows all about fighting in the Grand Prix."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17622\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Everything about him⑬his past, his age, his motivations⑬are shrouded in\n"
"a veil of mystery. However, his graceful dance within the ring is\n"
"reminiscent of the style of a certain man. It would not be an exaggeration\n"
"to say that this legendary man was resurrected in the Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17903\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Once upon a time, this man was respected as the strongest teacher of a\n"
"well-established dojo. However, greedy for strength, he broke the rules of\n"
"his dojo to travel to the Underground Coliseum and join the fight, throwing\n"
"away his position, his honor, and black belt in the process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18186\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A silver-haired boxer specializing in flurries of speedy punches.\n"
"Unsatisfied with the fight money he received in the boxing ring,\n"
"he came to the Underground Coliseum to go after the big cash\n"
"prize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18385\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Unable to hold down a job, he spent his time fighting on the streets until\n"
"he learned of the Coliseum. He has no formal style but his skill, honed in\n"
"years of street fights, is enough to take out even professional martial\n"
"artists. Now, he hopes to stand out among the Coliseum crowd."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18669\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"During his pursuit of the samurai spirit, he learned of the\n"
"Underground Coliseum and decided to join the fight. He uses a\n"
"strange fighting style that takes inspiration from his time\n"
"playing soccer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18867\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An out-boxer who fights like a bullfighter, constantly dodging\n"
"his opponent's attacks. After hearing about a tournament to\n"
"determine the strongest man on Earth, he came to the Underground\n"
"Coliseum all the way from Spain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19088\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A cleaner who is the pride of the Korean mafia. The flawless execution of\n"
"his contracts is well-known in the scene. It's said that after he finishes\n"
"a job, not a single speck of dust remains. To reinforce the status of his\n"
"homeland in the underworld, he came alone to the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19382\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man who spent his entire life fighting and steadily carved out a place\n"
"for himself in the underworld. No matter what resistance his opponents put\n"
"up, he always smashes through it with his fervent punches. His passionate\n"
"fighting style has captured the hearts of many a Coliseum-goer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19668\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man who fought off scores of gang resistance all by himself.\n"
"Especially well-known on America's West Coast. It's said there\n"
"is no fighting ground he cannot conquer.  He was sent to the\n"
"Underground Coliseum as an assassin from America."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "19905\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"This fighter's tactics, which take hints from volleyball, set him apart\n"
"from all the others. His finishing attack⑬spiking his foe into the ground\n"
"like a ball⑬has KO'd countless opponents. He came to the Underground\n"
"Coliseum seeking to hone his skills against its powerful fighters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20191\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Put an axe in this friendly man's hands, and he goes from gentle giant to\n"
"bloodthirsty berserker who loves nothing more than splitting his opponents\n"
"down the middle. He came to the Underground Coliseum after searching for\n"
"a fighting league that would permit weapons.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20460\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A wrestler who was once the king of tag matches. When his partner\n"
"died in an accident, however, he disappeared from the ring. He\n"
"appeared sometime later at the Underground Coliseum, declaring\n"
"that he would fight to honor the memory of his partner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20708\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An unrivaled boxer in his homeland of Ukraine. When no man stood\n"
"to face him, he abandoned his place at the top to seek strong\n"
"challengers in the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "20876\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A knife-wielding combatant who calls Kamurocho home. His skills\n"
"with the knife are unrivaled. He came to the Underground Coliseum\n"
"to see just how far his skills could take him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21053\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An MMA fighter who always finds his mark. He lost his father at\n"
"a young age, and now he lives by his father's dying words: \"Get\n"
"strong.\" He's come to the Underground Coliseum seeking the\n"
"strongest opponents he can find."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21273\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A newbie fighter who's never lost a street fight and fears no opponent.\n"
"After hearing he could make money by fighting, he headed to the Coliseum.\n"
"He's a slugger who lacks finesse and could use some training, but his\n"
"fighting spirit and courage are second to none."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21537\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A scythe-wielding combatant whose fighting career in the\n"
"Underground Coliseum began countless years ago. His scythe is\n"
"an extension of his body, and he's the only one capable of doing\n"
"justice to the title \"The God of Death.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "21762\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A cook who prefers cooking people over cooking for people. His skill with\n"
"his beloved kitchen knife is unrivaled, and he holds the speed record for\n"
"julienning vegetables. He came to the Coliseum in his search for a place\n"
"where he could swing his knife around without fear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22035\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A Kamurocho slugger who can clear a battlefield with a single\n"
"swing of his bat. He claims he was the Number 4 batter in the\n"
"lineup on a certain professional baseball team when he was\n"
"younger, but none have ever seen him on a baseball field..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22278\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An ex-wrestler who came back to Kamurocho after more than ten\n"
"years in prison. Unable to secure a job, he was about to turn to\n"
"a life of crime before he was approached by a promoter who brought\n"
"him back into the ring at the Underground Coliseum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22524\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A man whose love of martial arts movies led him to enter the ring himself.\n"
"No other fighter has done more image training than he has, even going so\n"
"far as to imagine himself the winner of the Coliseum. It's only a matter\n"
"of time before that image becomes reality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22788\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A boxer-puncher well-known in the USA. With a chin of diamond, no\n"
"boxer has ever been able to KO him. His friend, Mamoru Taiga,\n"
"invited him to participate in Tag Matches with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "22968\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A boxer who blew away the boxing world with his turbulent whirlwind of\n"
"punches. He won countless title matches, each title belt preceded by a\n"
"spectacular display of skill. He came to the Underground Coliseum to\n"
"participate in Tag Matches with Park Dong-ju."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23225\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Leader of a gang of punks who call Kamurocho their turf. Many members\n"
"joined his gang after witnessing his extraordinary fighting skills.\n"
"Joined up with partner in crime, Seiji Higuchi, to participate in tag\n"
"battles in the Underground Coliseum as the Kamuro Hooligans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23494\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Head of a biker gang that operates out of Kamurocho. Defeated\n"
"every leader in the gang until he stood at the top. He's joined\n"
"up with longtime partner Shogo Usui to participate in tag\n"
"battles and make his biker gang known to the underworld.  "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "23737\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of the Beast King Brothers, a pro wrestling tag team. Some have said\n"
"that watching the two coordinate with each other in the ring is like\n"
"watching art in motion. Came to the Underground Coliseum to show the\n"
"underworld that they are a tag team not to be trifled with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24008\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of the Beast King Brothers, a pro wrestling tag team. He\n"
"specializes in heavyweight offensive moves, unlike his partner,\n"
"Rex. Came to the Underground Coliseum to show the underworld that\n"
"they are a tag team not to be trifled with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24243\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"He and his partner Er-san are said to be the shining gems of the Chinese\n"
"Kung Fu world. His numerous skills born from the unique stances in Chinese\n"
"Kung Fu have an elegance not found in other martial arts. He has come to\n"
"the Underground Coliseum as part of his training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24514\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"He and his partner Yi-san are said to be the shining gems of the\n"
"Chinese Kung Fu world. Er-san is mild-mannered and popular, but\n"
"once he gets in the ring, he calmly beats his opponents to a pulp.\n"
"He has come to the Underground Coliseum as part of his training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "24775\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Defeat this fighter to learn more."
msgstr ""